Backported from LibreOffice master: https://github.com/LibreOffice/core/commit/f87c623b4e42
Applied unchanged.

From f87c623b4e426f19ab4666a22d0c2a04c2ecb2a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noel Grandin <noel.grandin@collabora.co.uk>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 10:29:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] lsan:fix leak in
 CairoPixelProcessor2D::getOrCreateCairoSurfaceHelper

shows up when running CppunitTest_sc_shapetest

probably from the recent changes here, when calling tryToGetCairoSurface.

Rather than doing explicit cleanup, lets follow the same path used in
  include/vcl/cairo.hxx
and pass around a shared_ptr that makes cleanup automatic.

Change-Id: I1bec6f579af182b259cb0edbd86192627e5c61ea
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.collaboraoffice.com/c/online/+/1858
Tested-by: Jenkins CPCI <releng@collaboraoffice.com>
Reviewed-by: Miklos Vajna <vmiklos@collabora.com>
(cherry picked from commit 70966239f816d81cb9dcb208e7c02e08339da28c)
(cherry picked from commit ee2349dba8aa282e30ae65cbf5ffbb27b707e0ec)
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.libreoffice.org/c/core/+/205990
Tested-by: Jenkins
Reviewed-by: Xisco Fauli <xiscofauli@libreoffice.org>


